  <string name="ow_insertion_label">OpenWhispr</string>
  <string name="ow_insertion_description">Types your dictation into the text box you’re typing in. What it reads: The text box you’re typing in (Only when you use the bubble); Text you select (Sent to your AI to edit. Never stored); Words you fix, for 45 seconds (Added to your dictionary, on your phone); The app you’re in (So the bubble shows only while you type). Never reads passwords. Never taps, sends or sells your text. Nothing saved to our cloud, unless you turn on Cloud backup.</string>
